OL,3,CEight fire crews at scene of large
OL,4,Cgrassland fire as people urged to
OL,5,Cavoid area
OL,7,FEight fire crews are tackling a large
OL,8,Fgrassland fire at a nature reserve
OL,9,Fnear Birmingham.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,Freports of a fire at Barr Beacon in
OL,13,FGreat Barr earlier today (Sunday 2
OL,14,FAugust).
OL,16,FBeacon Road has been closed in both
OL,17,Fdirections from B4151 Beacon Hill to
OL,18,FBridle Lane.
