OL,5,Cavoid area
OL,7,FWest Midlands Fire Service is urging
OL,8,Fpeople to keep windows and doors
OL,9,Fclosed and to avoid the area where
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,12,FThis is an ongoing incident and we
OL,13,Fwill continue to update this article.
